<title>FRANCE: Six wheat ships expected in Rouen by January 17.</title>
<headline>Six wheat ships expected in Rouen by January 17.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six grain ships are expected in Rouen by January 17 to load some 75,000 tonnes of wheat, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Two more vessels are expected by January 17 to load 82,000 tonnes of barley.</p>
<p>Destinations were not available.</p>
<p>One ship is currently at Rouen, loading 6,000 tonnes of wheat for Italy.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
